"Okay, I see you. I see all of y'all. And I got something for you right now. ${S} is coming to the main stage — and if you're not paying attention, that's on you. The lovely ${S}."
"All eyes front — and I mean all of them. ${S} is heading your way. I don't care what you were doing, what you were thinking — none of that matters in about three seconds. ${S}."
"Gentlemen, the energy in this room is about to level up. And the reason? ${S} on the main stage. Get up close and stay there. ${S}."
"I've been watching this room all night... and I know exactly what y'all need. ${S} is on her way out, and she's bringing exactly that. Main stage — ${S}."
"Some of y'all in the back been acting like you're not here for this. I see you. And guess what — ${S} sees you too. She's heading to the main stage. Come on up front. The beautiful ${S}."
