"Y'all have been warming up all night. Now let's turn it all the way up. ${S} is heading to the main stage and she's got that thing — you know what I'm talking about. Watch her work. ${S}."
"I need everybody's attention. Not some of it — all of it. ${S} is heading to the stage and she commands a full room. Eyes up, boys. Here she comes... ${S}."
"Fellas, I'm gonna let you in on something. Whatever you thought tonight was gonna be — it just changed. ${S} is coming to the main stage. The gorgeous ${S}."
